employment~s |   .0410013   .0181026     2.26   0.024     .0055192    .0764834
       _cons |  -1.046724   .6925855    -1.51   0.131    -2.404229    .3107816
-------------+----------------------------------------------------------------
     sigma_u |  .99820092
